{"id":"n84842-1-11","stage":5,"title":"폭격 · 轰炸","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84842-1-11-1","ko":"이 지역은 폭격을 맞아 폐허가 돼 버렸어요.","zh":"这个地区遭到了轰炸，已经变成了一片废墟。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"지역은","meaning":"地域，地区，区域","explanation":"지역：地域，地区，区域；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지역","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71487","senseId":"1","lemma":"지역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지역은","audio":"/audio/2c4160db5c50e8fb4118.mp3"}},{"text":"폭격을","meaning":"轰炸","explanation":"폭격：轰炸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"폭격","audio":"/audio/3c35ad5d8818ffa68962.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84842","senseId":"1","lemma":"폭격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폭격을","audio":"/audio/2b3839068ed601f84e1a.mp3"}},{"text":"맞아","meaning":"遭遇","explanation":"맞다：遭遇；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66232","senseId":"6","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"폐허가","meaning":"废墟","explanation":"폐허：废墟；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"폐허","audio":"/audio/60ffff7d5fd24d4cd911.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83276","senseId":"1","lemma":"폐허","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폐허가","audio":"/audio/5833deed673ce4da61e9.mp3"}},{"text":"돼","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되