","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않겠군요","audio":"/audio/d88688175f7f36560641.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"既然","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"已经这样的话。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/90d36b843c420524610e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.571,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84842","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.3977,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["原来如此。那应该就没人再住在那里了吧。","我来是想开一个新的存款账户。","这个地区遭到了轰炸，已经变成了一片废墟。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["原来如此。那应该就没人再住在那里了吧。","这个地区遭到了轰炸，已经变成了一片废墟。","我来是想开一个新的存款账户。"],"answer":0}]}
